{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.poster.avif?t=1757080049\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.webm?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.mp4?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt gentle ponds, shape terrain, and decorate with lilypads, reeds, rocks, and other natural elements. As you build, frogs arrive and your ecosystem slowly grows and responds to your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wrong answers, no timers, and no management stress - just the joy of watching your tranquil diorama come to life. Breed frogs, discover new varieties, and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of nature unfolding around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.poster.avif?t=1757080049\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.webm?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.mp4?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your pond throughout the year with different seasons, time of day, and weather - bringing unique visuals &amp; different ambient sounds to your pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind in a calm, colourful world filled with soft ambient sounds, playful wildlife, and the freedom to create your perfect serene pond.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1757080049","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924840?t=1757080049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757080049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/a1b811f7f1f867e3b71878c39dd3c778e730a505/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757080049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serene Ponds is a relaxing, free-form pond-building sandbox where creativity flows with no rules, goals, or pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.poster.avif?t=1757080049\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.webm?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/59a78657ad4bf83aba6ccc870363eaee.mp4?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sculpt gentle ponds, shape terrain, and decorate with lilypads, reeds, rocks, and other natural elements. As you build, frogs arrive and your ecosystem slowly grows and responds to your care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are no wrong answers, no timers, and no management stress - just the joy of watching your tranquil diorama come to life. Breed frogs, discover new varieties, and enjoy the peaceful rhythm of nature unfolding around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.poster.avif?t=1757080049\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.webm?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/extras/4b594163d349915b5c7783f0a749c7eb.mp4?t=1757080049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience your pond throughout the year with different seasons, time of day, and weather - bringing unique visuals &amp; different ambient sounds to your pond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unwind in a calm, colourful world filled with soft ambient sounds, playful wildlife, and the freedom to create your perfect serene pond.</p>","developers":["Snowscape Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924840/97b87d295712383ef20f0772b485bb661c4598fd/header.jpg?t=1757080049","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257187794,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187794/movie480.mp4?t=1756039796","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257187794/movie_max.mp4?t=1756039796"},"name":"Teaser","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257187794/5b975533c8e86634a